  )
  (text "GPIO map (same firmware for both variants)\n  GP2 / GP3      USB host D+ / D- (PIO-USB, 22 ohm series)        GP4 / GP5   UART1 TX / RX through the isolator\n  GP14 / GP15    SPI1 SCK / MOSI to microSD                        GP28 / GP29 SPI1 MISO / card CS\n  GP26           card detect (switch to GND, internal pull-up)     GP6         external RGB LED data (header J6)\n  GP16           on-board WS2812 of the RP2040-Zero (status)\n\nPower domains\n  side A  (+5V_IN, +5V_HOST, +5V_A, +3V3_A, GND_A): adapter on J1, MCU-A, USB host port, microSD.  PC 1 connects to U1's USB-C.\n  side B  (+3V3_B, GND_B): MCU-B, powered by PC 2 through U2's USB-C.  The only link between the sides is U3."
    (at 15.24 219.71 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid "fab441fe-b32d-4989-bea7-bc93f2e3ab8e")
  )
